{"seq":3,"slug":"controllable-generation","title":"可控生成技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conditional-generation","title":"条件音乐生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/conditional-generation","wordCount":1491,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"style-transfer","title":"风格迁移与融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/style-transfer","wordCount":1434,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-ai-collab","title":"人机协作音乐创作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/human-ai-collab","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 可控生成技术\n\n无条件的音乐生成只是起点——实际应用中，用户需要控制生成结果满足特定需求：指定风格、匹配情绪、适配视频节奏、延续已有旋律。可控生成（Controllable Generation）技术解决的核心问题是：如何在保持音乐质量的同时，让生成过程接受外部条件的引导。\n\n本章覆盖三种可控生成范式：条件生成（文本/音频/标签作为引导信号）、风格迁移与融合（将一种音乐的风格应用到另一种内容上）、以及人机协作工作流（AI 辅助而非替代创作者的实际应用场景）。可控性是 AI 音乐从\"技术演示\"走向\"实用工具\"的关键跨越。\n"}